# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# opt-datapath-perf: relax the two hardening options that cost measurable
# throughput on a machine whose job is moving packets and guest memory.
#
# Applied by the hypervisor profile.  Free-time poisoning in particular shows
# up on allocation-heavy paths like vhost-net.  Alloc-time init stays on.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CONFIG_INIT_ON_FREE_DEFAULT_ON is not set
